/- English proof (citation)
Apply `GlobalTheory.LatOrb.selfDual_matLat_stdLat` to the given parameters and hypotheses. The parameters and hypotheses occur in the same order in both statements, and the conclusions agree.

[Source theorem](?module=Development%2FAbelianVarietyTheory%2FProofs%2FDivisorProofs%2FIsSelfDualImageStandardLatticeUnitary.lean&line=17#L17)
